Vendored theme assets — attribution and license notice
======================================================

This directory contains theme templates, stylesheets, scripts and metadata
copied verbatim (or with the minimal adaptations noted below) from the
reference Sphinx distribution and the Alabaster theme package.  They are
included so that scribe can render the same HTML structure as its Python
oracle for the built-in `basic`, `classic` and `nature` themes and for the
third-party `alabaster` theme.

