3. Adaptations made by scribe
-----------------------------
* The original `theme.toml` / `theme.conf` metadata files are kept unchanged.
* Jinja2 `{% trans %}...{% endtrans %}` blocks are rewritten on load into
  equivalent `{% set %}` + inline text by `scribe-theme`'s preprocessor,
  because minijinja does not ship the i18n extension.  English output is
  unchanged; see ARCHITECTURE.md §20.
* HTML templates that Sphinx renders with its Python builder context are
  driven by scribe's `RenderContext` (see `scribe-theme`).  No template file
  content was otherwise changed.
